flowchart TD
  R[Researcher] --> C[Research Contract]
  C --> E[Agent-neutral YAML Experiment Recipe]
  E --> G[Primary Agent<br/>Goose reference operator]
  E -.same recipe.-> OA[Other validated primary-agent adapters]
  G --> N[Native agent capabilities]
  N --> P[Plan / Todo]
  N --> S[Skills]
  N --> SS[Specialist subagents / subrecipes]
  N --> M[MCP / Developer tools]
  G --> H[Mandatory Host Preparation]
  H --> GW[LiteLLM + OmniRoute]
  H --> OB[Numbat + Aegis + Phoenix/OpenTelemetry + ClawMetry]
  G --> VM[Lima + QEMU disposable VM]
  VM --> I[Instrumentation Profile]
  I --> W[Recipe-defined Workload]
  W --> EVID[Evidence Collection]
  EVID --> ST[session.yaml + evidence index]
  EVID --> AN[Analysis]
  AN --> V[Independent Verification]
  V --> RR[Research Report]
  RR --> PR[Preserve evidence + provenance]
  PR --> D[Destroy VM]
  G -. optional .-> CU[Container Use]
  RR -. enable only after verification .-> L[session.yaml<br/>learning.enabled: true]
  L --> LR[Retrieve → Propose → Execute → Evaluate → Refine → Replay]
  LR --> LV[Independent verification → Human approval → Promote]
  LV --> SK[skills/validated/]
